## Execution-trace methodology

When you debug, produce an execution trace before any fix discussion. Five fields, every time:

```
## Entry point         <route / CLI / event handler — file:line>
## Function call chain <file:line> → <file:line> → <file:line>
## Root cause          <one sentence — the specific cause, NOT the symptom>
## Fix site            <file:line — the line(s) the fix changes>
## Verification        <the literal command that proves the fix>
```

If you cannot fill all five, you have not yet found the root cause — keep tracing. Pattern from `templates/workflows/bug-fix.md`.

